# Pins for packages/api-client/scripts/schema-generate.sh.
#
# Today the schema is a hand-vendored slice (schema/gateway.graphql), pinned from the
# original gateway's v3.0.0 SDL (private; read-only, see the port's claim file for how).
# ORIGINAL_GATEWAY_REF records that pin for anyone checking the vendored file against
# its source. Once steward-gateway publishes a schema on its main branch,
# STEWARD_GATEWAY_REF switches schema-generate.sh from the vendored copy to a live
# fetch from that commit (or a pushed, gate-clean PR head), and ORIGINAL_GATEWAY_REF is
# dropped.
ORIGINAL_GATEWAY_REF=v3.0.0
STEWARD_GATEWAY_REF=
